<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS (1630 GMT).</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS (1630 GMT).</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Men's singles results on the ninth</p>
<p>day of the French Open tennis tournament on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Prefix number denotes seeding.</p>
<p>* denotes new results</p>
<p>Quarter-finals:</p>
<p>*Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat 3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia)</p>
<p>6-2 5-7 2-6 6-0 6-4</p>
<p>Filip Dewulf (Belgium) beat Magnus Norman (Sweden) 6-2 6-7</p>
<p>(2-7) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>(Ends men results)</p>
</text>
